{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":46,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比倫的假神"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["彼勒屈膝跪下，",{"text":"尼波彎腰降服。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些巴比倫的偶像馱在野獸和牲畜背上，成了重負，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使其疲憊不堪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們一同屈膝降服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不但救不了被擄的巴比倫人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己也被擄去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「雅各家啊，以色列家的餘民啊，都要聽我說。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們一出生，我就照顧你們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一出母胎，我就呵護你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你們年老髮白的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仍然一如既往地扶持你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我造了你們，必照顧你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呵護你們，拯救你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「你們拿誰與我相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使之與我同等呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們把誰比作我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使之與我相同呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有些人從囊中倒出金子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又用天平稱銀子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雇金匠製造神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然後向它俯伏叩拜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們把神像抬起來扛在肩上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"找個地方安置好，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它就在那裡呆立不動。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人向它呼求，它不能回應，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能救人脫離困境。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「你們這些悖逆的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要將這事銘記在心，仔細思想。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要記住古時發生的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是獨一無二的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是上帝，沒有誰能與我相比。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從太初就預言末後的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從亙古就宣佈將來的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的旨意必成就，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我想做的必實現。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從東方召來鷙鳥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從遙遠的地方召人來成就我的計劃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我言出必行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所謀必成。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這些冥頑不靈、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遠離公義的人啊，聽我說。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要親自施行公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那一天已經不遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩很快就會來臨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在錫安賜下救恩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我的榮美賜給以色列。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/46.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/47.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/45.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}